stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Registering
  Registering --> Unhealthy: dependency not ready
  Registering --> Rejected: protocol/schema/policy mismatch
  Registering --> Ready: identity + dependencies pass
  Ready --> Draining: stop new work
  Draining --> Drained: active work = 0
  Ready --> Unhealthy: required dependency lost
  Unhealthy --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]
  Drained --> [*]
